|------|-------|-------|
| sm | `rgba(36, 36, 36, 0.7) 0px 1px 5px -4px, rgba(36, 36, 36, ...` | `--shadow-sm` |
| subtle | `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) 0px 2px 0px 0px inset` | `--shadow-subtle` |
